  "headline": "Search Operation For Victims Of PT Fonusa Agung Mulia Fire Extended",
  "seoTitle": "Search Extended For PT Fonusa Agung Mulia Factory Fire",
  "metaDescription": "Search operations for victims of the PT Fonusa Agung Mulia candy factory fire in Cikande have been extended by three days due to site hazards.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Search and rescue efforts at the PT Fonusa Agung Mulia factory site have been extended for an additional three days.",
    "Operations have been complicated by unstable building structures and dangerous debris, requiring the deployment of K9 units.",
    "Heirs of the victims identified in the fire have reportedly received compensation totaling 253 million rupiah."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "Emergency services in Cikande, Banten, have extended the recovery operation at the PT Fonusa Agung Mulia candy factory following a large-scale fire. Officials from the Banten Search and Rescue Agency (Basarnas) confirmed that crews will continue working for three more days to locate any remaining victims within the site. The search process has faced significant challenges, including severe weather conditions, the presence of unstable building remains, and hazardous debris that have prevented investigators from clearing the area. Specialized canine units from the national police force have been deployed to assist in navigating the wreckage. Meanwhile, authorities are coordinating investigations with government industrial departments, and compensation has been issued to the families of those identified in the incident. Operations remain focused on areas of the facility that have not yet been fully inspected.",
